    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;If there is one thing you would really want to do before you graduate, what would it be?&quot;</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/60a7b63f4c780f3263f68dbf45c79736.poster.avif?t=1744030408\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/60a7b63f4c780f3263f68dbf45c79736.webm?t=1744030408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/60a7b63f4c780f3263f68dbf45c79736.mp4?t=1744030408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>In Between All Times</i> is a  cinematic-visual novel about an graduate student's struggles finding purpose and identity, set in a surreal future in the stars.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><br>You, a final year university student facing graduation soon, one day meet a mysterious campus ghost in your clubroom.<br><br>In this unexpected encounter the mysterious ghost named Byeol decides to join your club.<br><br>Together in this Literature Club, you and your new friend decides to complete a small goal you had always longed to fulfill.<br><strong>To write a short novel before graduation.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SO, IN BETWEEN ALL TIME...</h2><br>&quot;A story about one's very personal yet confusing creative journey.&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/51a2dc66b35a8d98fa2c79de2ca99b5b.avif?t=1744030408\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br><br><strong>A campus life in Space</strong><br>Enjoy your last year on a campus set in space, experience familiar moments of life in a unfamiliar world<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/3ca35e01bfbd64590d0c1ff7ace4cfc7.poster.avif?t=1744030408\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/3ca35e01bfbd64590d0c1ff7ace4cfc7.webm?t=1744030408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/3ca35e01bfbd64590d0c1ff7ace4cfc7.mp4?t=1744030408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Creative visuals of different art styles and motion graphics</strong><br>From quality ECGs to Cartoon CGs, Motion Graphic visuals will help you dive into the world of <i>In Between All Times</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/6b135a7cc8889b6661c582f9f065c1fb.poster.avif?t=1744030408\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/6b135a7cc8889b6661c582f9f065c1fb.webm?t=1744030408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/6b135a7cc8889b6661c582f9f065c1fb.mp4?t=1744030408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/13e99904ff37f0886c8b9bbb50b1e567.poster.avif?t=1744030408\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/13e99904ff37f0886c8b9bbb50b1e567.webm?t=1744030408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/13e99904ff37f0886c8b9bbb50b1e567.mp4?t=1744030408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>All for story, a Kinetic Novel</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/87d915e0cc4dd3263fcdef62cf4193ae.poster.avif?t=1744030408\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/87d915e0cc4dd3263fcdef62cf4193ae.webm?t=1744030408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/87d915e0cc4dd3263fcdef62cf4193ae.mp4?t=1744030408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOPMENT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917740/extras/e6dbcf060b4676979a54cc5775dd5e74.avif?t=1744030408\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>Studio Elysian is a South Korean story-based game development team founded in 2022.<br><br>The team consists of a diverse range of talents throughout Korea, with backgorunds in Film production, Comic Arts, Music Video Production and even Vocaloid Production.",
